{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id43722016"}, "name":{"label":"waiman0"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-17T08:40:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.3.0"}, "id":{"label":"10949362377"}, "title":{"label":"Support only fingerprint login on my ipad & SC pay not working"}, "content":{"label":"The latest version missing support of passkey or third party password manager \n\nNo response on swipe to transfer in SC pay\n\nUse a lot of storage\n☹️", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id476413107"}, "name":{"label":"ghjkabggjk"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-15T21:39:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.3.0"}, "id":{"label":"10943849425"}, "title":{"label":"360 有bug"}, "content":{"label":"無法提交redeem", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id220981221"}, "name":{"label":"SomeRandomUser1234"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-15T18:18:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.3.0"}, "id":{"label":"10943393693"}, "title":{"label":"Frustrating experience: Password field not being password field"}, "content":{"label":"The update in the username password page has led me to be unable to use a password manager to input the fields for me. In addition, the design choice to prevent pasting passwords into the input field severely impacts usability and accessibility. This is forcing me to manually type them each them I logged in. By obstructing the pasting functionality and restricting the use of password manager, SC definitely undermines user security and increases the risk of password compromise. I hope SC can prioritize user security and experience, and implement necessary improvements asap.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id596972344"}, "name":{"label":"NamedNick99"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-11T19:07:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.3.0"}, "id":{"label":"10929242478"}, "title":{"label":"3DS is now broken"}, "content":{"label":"In a recent update the 3DS transaction verification now defaults to a message in Traditional Chinese (my App and Phone language is English). That’s a big issue to start with.\n\nUpon deciphering the message, it appears 3DS auth now takes place via the app. Being a multi device user this is annoying compared to the SMS auth of the past. But obviously I am in the middle of making a purchase, so I power up my second device to open the SC app to approve. Of course I get a message to say ‘approval failed’, no reason given.\n\nIt then diverts to SMS approval. What a waste of time. Why not give the user the choice of how they want to 2FA?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
