{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id147808407"}, "name":{"label":"AWC168"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-04T21:54:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.3.0"}, "id":{"label":"10903444824"}, "title":{"label":"Terrible update"}, "content":{"label":"Require the user to login again every time I use the app - insanely inconvenient! And the FPS function when transferring over 10k HKD requires verification which is fine, but it requests the user to verify using the app; which means I need to quite the app - makes it virtually impossible to complete the transaction. The most awful update ever pls improve asap", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id687366083"}, "name":{"label":"l122455"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-02T21:04:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.3.0"}, "id":{"label":"10895420334"}, "title":{"label":"App not work with older iOS on older iPhone"}, "content":{"label":"It’s a major issue that the new version does not work with older iOS on older iPhone.  So people cannot use the mobile app or have to buy another iPhone.  Pity such a lack of consideration for people wanting to keep using the same older phone.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id226711865"}, "name":{"label":"Ryancheung0518"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-02-01T06:22:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.3.0"}, "id":{"label":"10888917435"}, "title":{"label":"Can’t use FPS after update"}, "content":{"label":"Can’t use FPS after update", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id205588526"}, "name":{"label":"carpetpacific"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-27T07:14:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"10870174343"}, "title":{"label":"Work in progress"}, "content":{"label":"While the app is an improvement compared to previous versions, a lot of the functions are still stuck with older versions. One can easily tell that the loading screens and some functions remain unchanged for ages (cardless withdrawal, contact support, etc). User experience feels dated and incoherent, but does the job most of the time. \n\nThese things take time, and mox is proof that a modern user experience can be achieved. Just wishing the SC app can feel more finished and suited for everyday use.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id152686391"}, "name":{"label":"Kenyee"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-25T09:37:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"10863107878"}, "title":{"label":"New interface after updates"}, "content":{"label":"I hate the new interface after updating the app. The new design looks cheap and all the buttons are repositioned. It takes time to study the app and relearn which is which. Please stop making drastic changes, especially the designs are not better than the previous one.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id160964030"}, "name":{"label":"Long term ScB client"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-24T18:57:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"10860761363"}, "title":{"label":"New app is much better"}, "content":{"label":"Finally, SCB has revamped the retail bank app. Now it is much easier to use and I can review and manage my money and handle 99% of the transactions via this app! No need to wait for day to day banking transactions. So good!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
