{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id43349914"}, "name":{"label":"licowcow"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-14T08:42:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"10821676690"}, "title":{"label":"無理鎖戶口"}, "content":{"label":"用faceID 登入，操作中突然登出，然後告知輸入密碼錯誤三次被鎖戶口⋯⋯⋯24小時後才能解鎖再登入。\n\n客戶服務態度輕浮，認為網上戶口24小時能解開是合理和有效率。\n\n舊app 不論UX 和穩定性都高極多，印象用咗5年有多都冇出過呢啲問題！", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
