{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id615927790"}, "name":{"label":"qooodo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-29T06:51:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"10759010463"}, "title":{"label":"開戶口永遠卡在身份證驗證"}, "content":{"label":"原本同事介紹諗住整個咩馬拉松存款，但係完全卡咗喺嗰個身份證驗證嗰度，聽客服講刪除咗再下載都唔得，用iPad都唔得，覺得個app有少少倒公司米。原本諗住喺滙豐嗰度轉50萬搞馬拉松，不過真係試咗好多次身份認證都唔得，完全見唔到所謂嘅綠色框，真係盡咗力。\niPhone 13 mini 前後鏡都影到相花都冇花", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id350154538"}, "name":{"label":"azntelle"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-29T05:10:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"10758661343"}, "title":{"label":"Pretty but not so functional"}, "content":{"label":"I liked the updated UI because it looked “prettier” but so disappointed with how it’s been such a pain having to log-in since i’ve changed phone. I’ve tried to enable face ID twice but it keeps asking me to log in with a username and password. Additionally, it seems harder to find what I need ex. transactions and balance - looks nice but not so intuitive. :(", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/reviews/id132601207"}, "name":{"label":"Janicechung"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-26T17:33:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"10748949052"}, "title":{"label":"卡數還款餘額提醒"}, "content":{"label":"有時候一個月卡數分開幾次入錢落去。\n希望SC可以扣我還咗個amount，話我知今個月剩低幾多未還，唔好只得Total月結單結餘，次次都要自己計。感謝", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/hk/review?id=445795688&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"應用程式"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
